# Copy to `.env` or `.env.local` for local Vite dev. Only `VITE_*` keys are exposed to the browser.

# VITE_APP_TITLE=My App

# --- Optional: Supabase browser client (@supabase/supabase-js) ---
# After you link a Supabase project in Webura, install the client (`npm add @supabase/supabase-js`)
# and either use the generated `src/integrations/supabase/client.ts` from Webura or read:
#   VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT_REF.supabase.co
#   VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your_publishable_anon_key
